            "verseId": "2CH.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "x",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "name": "ref",
              "type": "tag",
              "attrs": {
                "loc": "EXO.27.1+EXO.27.2"
              },
              "items": [
                {
                  "text": "Ukuf 27:1-2",
                  "type": "text"
                }
              ]
            },
            {
              "text": "\n",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Kabili apangile ubulambo bwa mukuba ubwali amakubiti amakumi yabili (20) mubutali na makubiti amakumi yabili (20) mubwipi, elyo na makubiti ikumi limo ukuya mu mulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4:1",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ekutila, bwalepele bamita pabula (9m) mubutali, bamita pabula (9m) mubwipi, elyo bamita bane na citika wa mita (4.5m) ukulola mu mulu.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "text": " ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.1",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.1"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "2",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:2"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "2",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Apanga icishiba icaengululwa ku fyela, icashinguluka, icali amakubiti ikumi limo ukufuma pa mpela ukufika pa mpela elyo amakubiti yasano ukuya mu mulu.",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4:2",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ekutila, icalepele bamita bane na citika (4.5m) ukufuma … elyo ukucilako panono bamita babili (2:25m) ukulola mu mulu.",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " Intambo iyalepa amakubiti amakumi yatatu (30)",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "note",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "style": "f",
            "caller": "#"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4:2",
              "type": "text"
            },
            {
              "text": "Ekutila, intambo iyalepa bamita ikumi limo na batatu na citika (13.5m).",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": " eyalebomba ukupiminako mukucishinguluka pamulu. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.2",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.2"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "3",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:3"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "3",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Pesamba apangilepo ifinama ifyapala bacilume ba ŋombe ukucishinguluka. Fyali ikumi limo pali kubiti umo. Apanga bacilume ba ŋombe ashitantika mu milongo ibili nashikambatila ku cishiba. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.3",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.3"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "4",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:4"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "4",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Icishiba caikala pa mulu wa bacilume ba ŋombe ikumi limo na babili (12). Batatu balolesha ku kapinda ka ku kulyo, batatu ku kapinda ka ku kuso, batatu ku kabanga elyo shitatu ku masamba. Icishiba catekwa pa mulu wa ŋombe, ne numa shashiko shakumanina pakati. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.4",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.4"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "5",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "2CH 4:5"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "5",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Umutika waciko waba nge cisansa ca lupi, no mulomo waciko waba ngo mulomo wa lukombo nangu uwe luba. Icishiba calesunga amenshi ayali balita amakana amakumi mutanda na mutanda (66,000).",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "2CH.4.5",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "2CH.4.5"
            ]
          }
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "para",
      "type": "tag",
      "attrs": {
        "style": "p"
      },
      "items": [
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
